  (a + i b) * (x_r + i x_i)
  = (a x_r - b x_i) + i (b x_r + a x_i)

  => [x_r']   [ a  -b ] [x_r]
     [x_i'] = [ b   a ] [x_i]

  SSM/SSD 的完整映射

  - 令状态 x = x_r + i x_i，Lambda = a + i b
  - 输入 u 为实数（常见情况）
  - B = B_r + i B_i，C = C_r + i C_i

  状态更新：

  x_r' = a*x_r - b*x_i + (B_r u - B_i u)
  x_i' = b*x_r + a*x_i + (B_i u + B_r u)

  => [x_r']   [ a  -b ] [x_r]   [ B_r  -B_i ] u
     [x_i'] = [ b   a ] [x_i] + [ B_i   B_r ]

  输出（实输出/共轭对称常见）：

  y = Re(C x) = C_r x_r - C_i x_i
  => y = [ C_r  -C_i ] [x_r; x_i]

  如果你要复数输出：

  y_r = C_r x_r - C_i x_i
  y_i = C_i x_r + C_r x_i
  => [y_r]   [ C_r  -C_i ] [x_r]
     [y_i] = [ C_i   C_r ] [x_i]

